<title>USA: Living Centers exploring strategies.</title>
<headline>Living Centers exploring strategies.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Living Centers of America Inc Tuesday said it is exploring alternatives to better position itself in the health care industry.</p>
<p>Among the options it is exploring are a merger, a sale of the company, a recapitalization, acquisitions or joint ventures.</p>
<p>It said Credit Suisse First Boston Corp and NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc are assisting the company in this process.</p>
<p>This positioning of the company may result in any one of a number of alternatives, the company said.</p>
<p>Living Centers, through its subsidiaries, offers health care services to senior citizens.</p>
